      <p begin="00:14.030" end="00:18.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Supreme, you're a bitch)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.840" end="00:21.260" ttm:agent="v1">She got thick thighs and she quirky like she Billie</p>
      <p begin="00:21.260" end="00:23.690" ttm:agent="v1">I be posted with this check, you see me counting up all these fifties</p>
      <p begin="00:23.690" end="00:26.180" ttm:agent="v1">You see me next up, flexed up, ridin' in a Tesla</p>
      <p begin="00:26.180" end="00:28.400" ttm:agent="v1">Took me half a year to finally blow up, now I'm next up</p>
      <p begin="00:28.400" end="00:30.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Like, wait (like, wait), finna make this shit my main</p>
      <p begin="00:30.790" end="00:33.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">All these opps, they tryna beef, but I'm invincible, Luke Cage (Tsaha)</p>
      <p begin="00:33.070" end="00:35.650" ttm:agent="v1">See me posted with these checks, I'm makin' more than your whole race</p>
      <p begin="00:35.650" end="00:37.990" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;The world is yours, my clique&quot; and then said &quot;We be on the stage&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:37.990" end="00:40.390" ttm:agent="v1">She got thick thighs and she quirky like she Billie</p>
      <p begin="00:40.390" end="00:42.630" ttm:agent="v1">I be posted with this check, you see me counting up all these fifties</p>
      <p begin="00:42.630" end="00:45.400" ttm:agent="v1">You see me next up, flexed up, ridin' in a Tesla</p>
      <p begin="00:45.400" end="00:47.360" ttm:agent="v1">Took me half a year to finally blow up, now I'm next up</p>
      <p begin="00:47.360" end="00:49.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Like, wait (like, wait), finna make this shit my main</p>
      <p begin="00:49.990" end="00:52.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">All these opps, they tryna beef, but I'm invincible, Luke Cage (Tsaha)</p>
      <p begin="00:52.470" end="00:54.900" ttm:agent="v1">See me posted with these checks, I'm makin' more than your whole race</p>
      <p begin="00:54.900" end="00:57.040" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;The world is yours, my clique&quot; and then said &quot;We be on the stage&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:57.040" end="00:59.300" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;Fuck that, we gon' bust back&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:59.300" end="01:01.610" ttm:agent="v1">My homie said you barely could afford a dubsack</p>
