      <p begin="01:04.290" end="01:06.510" ttm:agent="v1">I keep a Tay-K, baby, I'm a rugrat</p>
      <p begin="01:06.510" end="01:09.120" ttm:agent="v1">I said, we some Rugrats covered in the slime, Nickelodeon</p>
