      <p begin="01:11.400" end="01:14.030" ttm:agent="v1">To the top, presidential, looking down from the podium</p>
      <p begin="01:14.030" end="01:16.360" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma throw a fuckin' fit if they don't let my homie in</p>
      <p begin="01:16.360" end="01:18.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm on trip time, I'm gon' get mines (bitch)</p>
      <p begin="01:18.600" end="01:21.020" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;I'm gon' see you motherfuckers at the finish line&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:21.020" end="01:23.320" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;Baby, can you be the one to help me get right?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:23.320" end="01:25.350" ttm:agent="v1">Said, &quot;Baby, can you be the one that I go see at night?&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:25.350" end="01:28.420" ttm:agent="v1">I said, &quot;We can leave the past in the past, no more Tommy on the brand&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:28.420" end="01:30.860" ttm:agent="v1">Two ho's, ten toes, new guap, countin' bands</p>
      <p begin="01:30.860" end="01:33.100" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck everything they sayin' 'cause we everything they can't</p>
      <p begin="01:33.100" end="01:35.490" ttm:agent="v1">Getting rich, now we rich, he bought Moncler pants</p>
      <p begin="01:35.490" end="01:38.050" ttm:agent="v1">She got thick thighs and she quirky like she Billie</p>
      <p begin="01:38.050" end="01:40.380" ttm:agent="v1">I be posted with this check, you see me counting up all these fifties</p>
      <p begin="01:40.380" end="01:43.290" ttm:agent="v1">You see me next up, flexed up, ridin' in a Tesla</p>
      <p begin="01:43.290" end="01:45.050" ttm:agent="v1">Took me half a year to finally blow up, now I'm next up</p>
